  areas="The partner team most often unloads in Whitefield, Marathahalli, Bellandur, Sarjapur Road, HSR Layout, Koramangala, Electronic City, Hebbal, Thanisandra, Yelahanka, Hennur, JP Nagar, Bannerghatta Road and KR Puram.",
